  "description": "Ingestion throughput and stage timings from the pipeline container logs in VictoriaLogs (instance=prod-podcast, surface=pipeline). Parses stdout lines containing `episode_metrics:` from `orchestration._log_episode_metrics` (transcribe_sec, summary_sec, audio_sec, retries, tokens, estimated_cost; `null` values filtered out). Series are grouped by `surface` because container names are per-run. **Not in these log lines:** separate GI vs KG seconds, run-level `run.json` aggregates, or API Prometheus histograms; see the ingestion (Prometheus) dashboard for those.",
